  name: english
  flag: {fileID: 0}
  lore_text:
  - though there are many theories, myths and legends on the true nature of <color=#1B0035>somatic
    thaumaturgy</color> no answer has yet to be decisive and wholly conclusive, the
    <color=#516134>monks of ajensveria</color> say its the key to ascending beyond
    the mortal shell, the <color=#633535>painters of rionosku</color> say it exacts
    the users essence upon the world, some yet cling to logic and science saying
    it can all be understood and explained.
  - the only fact known for sure is that by casting <color=#1B0035>symbols</color>
    with ones own body they can force powerful effects upon reality, the price of
    this cast it to momentarily expose oneself to <color=#1B0035>powers beyond human
    reckoning</color>, and as such the body is warped to fit new purpose, bones duplicate
    and offset, the body shifts such requiring that the user <color=#294c6e>inevitibly
    abandons the warped path to adopt new skin.</color>
  - '- <color=#294c6e>arlys brightover, scholar of the arts, high principator of
    ordoniss</color>'
  - when one casts using <color=#1B0035>som thaum</color> they briefly escape reality.
    it is here that beings of great power exist who through curiosity or great mistake
    will "dissasemble" the <color=#1B0035>acolyte</color>, these beings are not malicious
    though and will reasemble the individual to working order, though their inhumanity
    leads to imperfections and "warpings"
  - <color=#022240> - jozzo the kind</color>
  - <color=#1B0035>hexecraft</color>, as defined by <color=#322E21>me</color> is
    the illogical extension of applied sciences as we know it, among all the forms
    it can take there is one similarity, patterns. by creating a specific shape through
    a medium you can cause an <color=#1B0035>effect</color>. perhaps with more understanding
    <color=#1B0035>som thaum</color> could be performed without the use of the body,
    though <color=#322E21>i</color> wonder what it would be called then.
  - <color=#322E21> - samuel somatathon </color>
  - <color=#1B0035>best record (so far)</color>
  - '<color=#1B0035>least spells cast : </color>'
  - '<color=#1B0035>time : </color>'
  info_text:
  - in spite of <color=#022240>their</color> prowess in <color=#1B0035>hexes</color>
    <color=#022240>jozzo</color> has no method to directly harm  <color=#322E21>me</color>,
    that doesnt make them a pacifist in spite of <color=#022240>their</color> title
    as  <color=#022240>jozzo</color> has summoned <color=#39342E>maurice</color>
    to this place.
  - <color=#022240>jozzo the kind</color> has secluded <color=#022240>theirselves</color>
    behind door 783
  - in spite of <color=#322E21>my</color> attempts to aproach on foot <color=#022240>jozzo's</color>
    <color=#1B0035>casting</color> will always push <color=#322E21>me</color> further
    away from <color=#322E21>my</color> goal and closer towards <color=#39342E>maurice</color>.
  - <color=#322E21>i</color> have fashioned a simple  totem to aid in my travels,
    <color=#322E21>i</color> find the process of crafting these <color=#1B0035>effigies</color>
    quite thereputic. if memory serves [R] should place and recall.
  - <color=#022240>jozzo</color> had the forthought to place a <color=#1B0035>hex</color>
    to bar <color=#322E21>my</color> <color=#1B0035>hexes</color>, <color=#322E21>i</color>
    cannot directly move to 783 while it remains, <color=#322E21>i</color> can feel
    it at Z
  - <color=#022240>jozzo</color> crafted this space to trap the both of <color=#322E21>i</color>,and
    while <color=#022240>its</color> <color=#1B0035>hexecraft</color> is highly polished
    this space is poorly concieved.
  - beyond doors 0 and 999 lies the periphery, <color=#39342E>maurice</color> seems
    to always lurk there.
  cast_text:
  - '<color=#1B0035>CAST</color> :  core component to my strongest spells'
  - '<color=#1B0035>EXPULSE</color> : moves target away from <color=#322E21>me</color>'
  - '<color=#1B0035>MEND</color> : mends space betwixt targets'
  - '<color=#1B0035>TOTEM</color> : old reliable, great grocery shopping'
  - '<color=#1B0035>LOOP</color> : i trapped somone in a <color=#1B0035>loop</color>
    once, dont think i ever let them out'
  - '<color=#1B0035>CLEAVE</color> : cleaves space, doesnt work great on parma ham'
  - '<color=#1B0035>DOOR</color> : 235 wish it picked a closer door.'
  - '<color=#1B0035>CONVERGE</color> : only use of smooth surfaces, you do not want
    trip'
  - '<color=#39342E>MAURICE</color> : dont know why <color=#322E21>i</color> know
    <color=#39342E>it''s</color> name'
  - '<color=#022240>DOOR 783</color> : <color=#322E21>my</color> goal, <color=#022240>jozzo</color>
    will never let <color=#322E21>me</color> close.'
  - '<color=#1B0035>DECIMATE</color> : remember to stand far away from target.'
  - <color=#1B0035>hexes</color> are cast with [space] requires a component marked        
    or         .
  - '<color=#322E21>SAM</color> : thats <color=#322E21>me</color> baby!'
  - '<color=#1B0035>DOWN</color> : solution to a <color=#022240>kind</color> problem,
    use on targets to resolve with ease'
  - '<color=#1B0035>REVERSE</color> : remember to check what way you are facing'
  - '<color=#1B0035>IMPULSE</color> : great for getting around'
  Lcast_text:
  - '<color=#1B0035>CAST</color> :  core component to my strongest spells'
  - '<color=#1B0035>EXPULSE</color> : moves target away from <color=#322E21>me</color>'
  - '<color=#1B0035>MEND</color> : mends space betwixt targets'
  - '<color=#1B0035>TOTEM</color> : old reliable, great grocery shopping'
  - '<color=#1B0035>LOOP</color> : i trapped somone in a <color=#1B0035>loop</color>
    once, dont think i ever let them out'
  - '<color=#1B0035>CLEAVE</color> : cleaves space, doesnt work great on parma ham'
  - '<color=#1B0035>DOOR</color> : 235 wish it picked a closer door.'
  - '<color=#1B0035>CONVERGE</color> : only use of smooth surfaces, you do not want
    trip'
  - simple component for <color=#322E21>my</color> most powerful <color=#1B0035>hex</color>,
    its belligerant and only cooperates with the correct marked components.
  - pushes target 311.6154m  (200 doors) from <color=#322E21>user</color>. caution
    should be applied to not target <color=#322E21>self</color>.
  - <color=#1B0035>mends</color> space, great for repairing damage dealt by <color=#1B0035>cleave</color>,
    elsewise it will make new space between <color=#322E21>user</color> and target.
  - some <color=#1B0035>hexists</color> would have you believe that an <color=#1B0035>effigy</color>
    requires shiny materials and precise chants but sticks and twine always worked
    for <color=#322E21>me</color>.
  - forms a <color=#1B0035>loop</color> at target, each target can only sustain one
    <color=#1B0035>loop</color>. upon making a second relative <color=#1B0035>loop</color>
    it will either collapse both <color=#1B0035>loops</color> or bridge 2 already
    present <color=#1B0035>loops</color>.
  - <color=#1B0035>cleaves</color> space between target and <color=#322E21>user</color>,
    pulling them closer. most effective at longer distances.
  - the logic behind what objects or effects the <color=#1B0035>hex</color> shall
    choose is not well understood by many, to some its random but there is a pattern.
  - pulls target and <color=#322E21>user</color> closer together. makes <color=#322E21>me</color>
    glad to have 3 stable legs to stay upright.
  Rcast_text:
  - ephemeral entity on the cusp of existence, due to <color=#39342E>it's</color>
    nature i cannot be certain where <color=#39342E>it</color> is at any time.
  - <color=#022240>jozzo</color> is a potent caster, but <color=#322E21>i'm</color>
    much faster. <color=#322E21>my</color> spells can bring <color=#322E21>me</color>
    closer to <color=#022240>it</color> than my legs ever could.
  - explells an area of space around the target, space is added to edge of realm
    shortly after.
  - for a succesful <color=#1B0035>hex</color> <color=#322E21>i</color> need an effect
    [    ] and a target [   ], noted to each spell is the fingers needed to be curled
    to cast it.
  - <color=#322E21>i</color> never liked the fact that <color=#322E21>my</color>
    essence could be boiled down and effected by just one finger
  - combine with components marked [    ], resolves target, great for removing stains.
  - flips targets position to opposite end of the realm. makes me dizzy every time.
  - pulls <color=#322E21>user</color> (thats <color=#322E21>me</color>) toward target
    by 137.3124m (100 doors)
  - '<color=#39342E>MAURICE</color> : dont know why i know <color=#39342E>it''s</color>
    name'
  - '<color=#001021>DOOR 783</color> : <color=#322E21>my</color> goal, <color=#001021>jozzo</color>
    will never let <color=#322E21>me</color> close.'
  - '<color=#1B0035>DECIMATE</color> : remember to stand far away from target.'
  - <color=#1B0035>hexes</color> are cast with [space] requires a component marked        
    or         .
  - '<color=#322E21>SAM</color> : thats <color=#322E21>me</color> baby!'
  - '<color=#1B0035>DOWN</color> : solution to a <color=#022240>kind</color> problem,
    use on targets to resolve with ease'
  - '<color=#1B0035>REVERSE</color> : remember to check what way you are facing'
  - '<color=#1B0035>IMPULSE</color> : great for getting around'
  up_info_text:
  - for a <color=#1B0035>hexist</color> to cast a <color=#1B0035>hex</color> via
    <color=#1B0035>somatic thaumaturgy</color> they need to form a correct symbols,
    for <color=#322E21>me</color> that means aligning <color=#322E21>my</color> fingers
    to cast the correct <color=#1B0035>hexes</color>
  - to articulate <color=#322E21>my</color> fingers [lmb] and [rmb] are needed with
    the <color=#1B0035>cast</color> itself being [space]
  - <color=#1B0035>casting</color> comes with a 'cost' as many put it and while the
    warping has certainly effected <color=#322E21>me, my</color> body remains perfectly
    functional though strange new functions seem to brew,
  - every time <color=#322E21>i</color> clap <color=#322E21>my</color> hands <color=#322E21>my</color>
    fingers seem to swap.
  - <color=#39342E>maurice</color> is relentless in its pursuit, <color=#39342E>it's</color>
    goal seems solely to hunt though <color=#322E21>i</color> find that hard to believe,
    if <color=#39342E>it</color> draws too close <color=#322E21>i</color> should
    <color=#1B0035>cast</color>, the reforming of reality should dispell <color=#39342E>it</color>
    for a moment. or if <color=#322E21>i</color> draw it close to <color=#022240>jozzo,
    they</color> shall do it for <color=#322E21>me</color>.
  - <color=#022240>jozzo</color> will make moves depending on my actions, if <color=#322E21>i</color>
    approach <color=#322E21>i</color> am moved away, if <color=#322E21>i</color>
    am away from <color=#39342E>maurice then maurice</color> is moved closer, if
    <color=#322E21>i</color> aproach the <color=#1B0035>hex</color> is moved elsewhere.
  - some feel <color=#022240>jozzo's</color>  chosen title "the kind" is of a strange
    sort considering past actions though none have ever seen <color=#022240>them</color>
    render personal harm.
  menu_text:
  - 'master audio : '
  - 'ambient audio : '
  - 'player audio : '
