  beginning_text:
  - jozzo has trapped me in this space
  - jozzo is hiding at door 783
  - i get the feeling i could view my tome with [TAB]
  - that was good
  - but i can do it faster!
  book_text:
  - i get the feeling i can move between pages with [lmb] and [rmb]
  - wonder if the warrenty was ever voided on this tome
  - old reliable, wouldnt be able to keep my spells without it
  - wonder if ill ever run out of pages
  caution_text:
  - i get the feeling i dont want to do that
  - i dont think i would like the outcome
  - thats inadvisable
  - i dont want to do that
  idle_text:
  - wonder where maurice is now
  - wonder whats going on below
  - airs a bit stale in here
  - wonder if its ever going to get worse
  - i dont even know if i can warp any further
  - craving burritos right now
  - wonder if "the kind" is their last name?
  - makes me miss home... scratch that this place is better
  casting_text:
  - casting always gives me a buzz, in a bad way that is.
  - think i saw a face that time.
  - wonder if i am actually getting any closer
  - bet jozzo doesnt know that one!
  - dread to think what spells michael has...
  - hexes without calculation
  interact_text:
  - its a door
  - not this one
  - dont like this door... for some reason
  - some good quality wood? on this door
  - stamped sheet metal? cheapskates...
  - i need to find 783
  end_text:
  - i have finally reached you
  - not much to say for yourself?
  - maybe you arent able to talk
  - 'i need to CAST : DOWN to kill jozzo'
  - this is why i hate wizards
  - 'i need to CAST : DOWN to kill jozzo'
  - maybe you arent able to talk
  - not much to say for yourself?
