  - this is why i hate wizards
  - this is why i hate wizards
  - jozzo the kind, evil fuckass wizard (legal name) i will strike you down!
  cast_down_text:
  - i need to destroy that
  - 'i should CAST : DOWN'
  - 'CAST : DOWN would be best'
  - 'i need to CAST : DOWN quickly'
  maurice_text:
  - i need to cast to get out of here before maurice arrives
  - i wont let you get me this time!
  - i need to get out of here
  - maurice aproaches
  - you really are persistent maurice
